{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>無法阻止念頭浮現，但可以練習讓它更快流走。Unhook 協助你察覺令自己緊張的思緒，設定目標，並訓練自己更快放下，適合容易反覆糾結、被同一件事纏繞的人。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>設定時限練習放開思緒</h2>\n<p>設定一個時限（例如 5 秒）與一段持續時間（數小時或數日），只要每個念頭都在時限內散去，就能達成目標；若有一個念頭停留過久，計時便由零重新開始，這份重新出發正是建立習慣的紀律。練習時跟隨圓環呼吸，讓念頭自然流走，並可觀察自己放下的速度逐漸加快。無帳號、無廣告、無追蹤，資料只留在裝置上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-283-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-284-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-285-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-286-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-287-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-288-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Unhook: Let it pass</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T15:39:34.590569+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}